{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkebQBnd8j2PPTPtPDZA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm leaning toward **Harel (הראל), the track called \"כספי (שקלי)\"**, but I'm not sure. I won't open anything until I've talked to you or to someone at the bank.\n\nWhy that one: Harel is the only company here whose name I know. That track shows \"0%\" next to \"מניות\", so no shares. It says \"3 שנים 4.25%\" and \"5 שנים 3.08%\", which looks like a deposit, just a bit more. The bank fee is \"0.57%\" next to \"מהחיסכון\" and \"0%\" next to \"מההפקדות\". That doesn't look like much, but I don't know if 0.57% every year is a lot.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **First screen:** the big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". There's a row of product buttons, and \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" was already lit up. Under it is another row full of track names: \"מניות\", \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדדים\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\". Straight away it's shares and English letters, and I almost left. I stayed only because I came for this.\n2. **Harel's tracks:** here I read the track names and the fees. I liked \"כספי (שקלי)\" and \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\" because government bonds are safe. But I never found a row for the government bonds, only the button above.\n3. **מור:** I don't know that company. I glanced at it and moved on.\n4. **אנליסט:** also unknown, and also only a glance.\n5. **מיטב:** I saw that they also have \"כספי (שקלי)\", with \"4.41%\" over three years. Then I stopped, after five screens. Ten more screens I didn't read.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדדים\" (for me מדד is the one on the news), \"מט\"ח\", \"גמיש\", \"משולב סחיר\", \"אג\"ח סחיר\".\n- In the returns column many rows say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" and \"פחות מ־5 שנים\" instead of a number. Less than what?\n- One row at Meitav says \"101%\" shares. How can it be more than a hundred?\n- One row says \"עוד לא דווח\" with a small orange sign. It frightened me.\n- There's a line \"TODO: מיון לפי תשואה\". It looks like something they forgot to finish.\n- I couldn't read the circles at all. The green and the yellow are hard to tell apart for me.\n- The column headings are small and grey on black, and the \"?\" signs are tiny. The whole page is black with light writing, and it tires my eyes.\n\n**Where I got tired or worried**\nBy the third screen it was all numbers, in every row, and it just kept going. Big numbers like \"24.04%\" and \"26.39%\" catch the eye, but they're on shares, and I've already been burned once with a fund. I also didn't see a bank name anywhere, and that bothers me.\n\n**What I would change**\n- Show the safe tracks first, with one sentence that explains what each one means.\n- Use a light background and bigger writing.\n- Take out the English letters, or explain them.\n- Explain \"פחות מ־3 שנים\".\n- Remove the \"TODO\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1903,"cache_read_input_tokens":11588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1903},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10f4396a-1764-4e9b-baba-e4a912db19f4","uuid":"5e5e9882-0466-4551-9a47-22cb5cbbeff2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:28:41.009Z","request_id":"req_011CgkebPEVS4RTZHq371ak8"}
